Rāma bids Vibhīṣaṇa repeat counsel before monkeys --- Vibhīṣaṇa reports troops arrayed and urges dropping grief --- Vibhīṣaṇa urges sending Lakṣmaṇa to Nikumbhilā shrine --- Indrajit holds Brahmaśiras slayable only before rite ends --- Rāma knows foe illusion and sky concealment --- Rāma sends Lakṣmaṇa with monkeys Hanumān Jāmbavān and guide Vibhīṣaṇa --- Lakṣmaṇa arms touches Rāma feet and vows Rāvaṇi death --- Lakṣmaṇa marches swiftly with Vibhīṣaṇa Hanumān and bear host --- Lakṣmaṇa sees foe arrayed and enters hostile force
